{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e493f0e61a410cb2ebc569aa502616956871f42e1bdcbe854dcc5464d80eafc7","ja":"雪歩……カメラマンさんと\n会ってたんだね。よかった～……。","zh":"雪步……原来你见过摄影师先生啊。太好了～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1ee9d1b087c7d3f6c9eab50bb13356523335cf1863375ae7998ad5ce052e1488","ja":"あれ、真ちゃん？\nよかったって、なにかあったの？","zh":"咦，小真？\n你说太好了，是发生什么事了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"445b33ce9b3d52490e094140b9706b69824efbed5e2b5bbb58db7dac559f19b6","ja":"い、いや、なんでもないんだ。それよりも……\n公演中の写真を受け取ってたの？","zh":"不、不是，没什么。先不说这个……你收到演出中的照片了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"09da80e9df5d0f8366dabd5e0643d416a6efb22e5793070f724980851cc1bc38","ja":"うん。カメラマンさんにお願いしてたの。ライブ中の、\n一番、せ、セクシーな私を撮ってもらえますかって。","zh":"嗯。我拜托摄影师了。请他在演出过程中，把最、最性感的我拍下来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"31d0a9401a205d2ee11447f8df6625143a66d3b5498a7fb6da0543448572cff0","ja":"写真で見たら、ちょっとは自信になるかもだし……\n勉強になるかなって……。は、はずかしいけど……。","zh":"如果看到了照片，说不定能稍微增加点自信……\n我想也许能学到些东西……虽、虽然有点不好意思……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b66d76be07bf8b652645c1fda04e4b2654f456c3d2230c5c518d97f989da9a96","ja":"でも、ひんそーでちんちくりんな私だけど、『Xs』の\nみんなに迷惑かけたくないって思って……だから。","zh":"可是，虽然我身材单薄又矮小，但我不想给『Xs』的大家添麻烦……所以。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"faf520329806060e09237864e97445b9510290bda4de687aaa833828ea0de1f1","ja":"そうだったんだ……。ねえ、ボクにも見せてよ！\nセクシーな雪歩を見て、ボクも勉強するからさ！","zh":"原来是这样啊……呐，也让我看看吧！我也要看看性感的雪步，学习一下嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ee1f16a0e036c1fc8e62218fa74264ed9c06f82043f8298a36ad048d42f0176f","ja":"わ、私で参考になるかわからないけど……真ちゃん\nなら……♪　これと、あと前の写真がロッカーに……。","zh":"我、我不知道自己能不能帮上忙作参考……不过，要是小真的话……♪ 这张，还有之前的照片，都在储物柜里……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5cc50f442c59e5d8147bc619ee4d79a8e1573b921540ab889e21111f48e93cbc","ja":"……雪歩が会ってた人って、\nカメラマンさんだったんだね。あはっ☆","zh":"……原来雪步见的人是摄影师啊。啊哈☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"46c19b4436ee6ea19453516795439ec310bb5cdb54c2aa77c6853aced0e9c63b","ja":"まったく……そんなことだろうと\n思ってたわ。心配して損しちゃった。","zh":"真是的……我就知道会是这样。白担心了一场。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_827.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"aedb88674f1822c89f9ffce703cb4b01894961a4d67af0d780160e650611f432","ja":"ふーん……やっぱり心配だったんだ。\nでこちゃんって、あいかわらず素直じゃないの♪","zh":"嗯……果然还是担心了啊。小额头还是一如既往地不坦率呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
